<title>USA: Premier Banshares president/CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Premier Banshares president/CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Bancshares Inc said Monday that President and Chief Executive J. Edward Mulkey has resigned.</p>
<p>Mulkey, who also resigned from from the boards of Premier Bancshares and its subsidiaries, will continue to serve as a consultant for the next year, the company said. The resignation is effective July 31.</p>
<p>The company said that Robert Oliver has been named president and chief executive, and will retain his chief operating officer's post.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
